From 57edc21916f58ce3e953616474d40bcb3d5caf2c Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: yaegerbomb42 <yaeger.james42@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 12 Nov 2026 19:59:29 -0600
Subject: [PATCH] feat(library): per-user custom tools, MCP servers, connectors
 and skills

Add a per-account Library with a browser UI and API:
- custom script and HTTP tools (form builder or raw JSON Schema), with
  timeout/output caps and SSRF guards, run via a generated user-tools MCP
  server inside the user's VM
- the agent can call saved tools and create_tool for itself; created tools
  merge back into the library after the run
- user-added and catalog MCP servers, connectors, and skills, with secrets
  sealed at rest and only last-4 masks returned to clients
- public catalogs shown for review before install

Co-Authored-By: Claude Code <noreply@anthropic.com>
